    faster-whisper and CTranslate2 (MIT), ONNX Runtime (MIT), OpenCV (Apache 2.0);
  - models: Qwen3-VL (Apache 2.0), Stable Diffusion XL base 1.0 (CreativeML Open RAIL++-M) with the SDXL fp16-fix
    VAE (MIT), Stable Diffusion 1.5 (CreativeML Open RAIL-M), CLIP ViT-L/14 (MIT), faster-whisper large-v3-turbo
    (MIT), YuNet face detector (MIT).
  The wizard program (Picture Model Training.exe) includes wxPython (wxWindows Library Licence) and cytolk (MIT).
Each picture collection's licence and credit is in the kit's ATTRIBUTION.txt of every trained add-on.
